[OC]This is a 10-man dungeon. You or somebody in your party must have the *Seal of Ascension* to be able to enter Upper Blackrock Spire
[OC]Travel to Azshara
[G 79.28,73.7 Azshara]Talk to *Duke Hydraxis* \\ These two quests unlock *Eye of the Emberseer* for Upper Blackrock Spire. To skip the optional Hydraxis chain, tick this pickup row and skip the Silithus, Eastern Plaguelands and Azshara detours for Hydraxis. Continue to *Mayara Brightwing* in Burning Steppes for *Doomrigger's Clasp*. \\ Accept [QA6804 Poisoned Water] \\ Accept [QA6805 Stormers and Rumblers]
