[G 21.09,22.33,60 Silithus][G 24.12,14.81,50 Silithus]Kill *Dust Stormers* and *Desert Rumblers* \\ [QC6805,1 Stormers and Rumblers] \\ [QC6805,2 Stormers and Rumblers]
[OC]Travel to Eastern Plaguelands
[G 56.46,68.9,50 Eastern Plaguelands][L 62.54,26.9 Eastern Plaguelands][L 44.57,41.04 Eastern Plaguelands]Use the *Aspect of Neptulon* on the *Water Elementals*, then kill them. Loot them for their *Discordant Bracers* \\ They can be killed in three different locations in EPL. They are marked on your map \\ [QC6804,1 Poisoned Water][UI17310-]
